et 1 ring that I needed to be able to have a decent bow build going.\nNever showed. Gave up. Downloaded a tool to let me see what dungeons I'd roll just by resetting my world without having to go into it over and over, and rolled 120 times, and it didn't show up once. Not. Once.\nOther than the RNG, gameplay is disgustingly average, story was one of the worst things about the game, and the lack of weapons to choose from make this really just a complete waste of time and money.\nAlong with increasing difficulty just being \"more enemies that hit harder and/or one shot you\", we had to really LOOK for the fun to be found in this game, and by doing every side dungeon, we delayed the inevitable or the actual campaign, which was probably 3 hours long in total. Game felt way too much like Destiny, and the classes felt bare bones at best.\nDon't make the mistake I did. Spend your money somewhere else.\nOr don't. Not gonna tell you how to live your life.", "timestamp_created": 1699333575, "timestamp_updated": 1699333575, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.314984589815139771", "comment_count": 7, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149687659", "author": {"steamid": "76561198302733884", "personaname": "fs_hyena", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198302733884/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 10280, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6674, "last_played": 1732232343, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "english", "review": "A compelling and awesome story similar to the first much more customizability and quite enjoyable to play with friends besides some hiccups in the beginning I am quite satisfied and looking forward to DLC good w